# --- bolabuster operational hygiene ---
# Do NOT commit real identity configs (they hold live tokens/cookies)
# or scan reports (repro_curl embeds live attacker credentials).
# Keep only the sanitized files under examples/.
identities.y*ml
scope.y*ml
!examples/identities.y*ml
!examples/scope.y*ml
reports/
*.report.json
*.report.txt

